function openChapterCards(){if(!review)remember();openModal('章節回憶',c=>{if(!review){remember();importChapterMemories();}$('modal').dataset.panel='chapters';const items=memories.list(),unlocked=items.filter(x=>x.count).length;const intro=node('div',undefined,'chapter-gallery-intro');intro.appendChild(node('p','海風中的足跡','chapter-kicker'));intro.appendChild(node('p',unlocked?'已留下 '+unlocked+' 段章節回憶':'隨著旅程前進，章節將逐一點亮。','chapter-count'));c.appendChild(intro);chapterViewControls(c);const grid=node('div',undefined,'chapter-grid');for(const item of items){const b=button(grid,'',()=>chapterDetail(item.number),'chapter-card');b.dataset.chapter=String(item.number);b.disabled=!item.count;b.appendChild(node('span',item.number?String(item.number).padStart(2,'0'):'序','chapter-number'));const copy=node('span',undefined,'chapter-card-copy');copy.appendChild(node('strong',item.count?item.title:'尚未抵達'));copy.appendChild(node('small',item.count?'已讀 '+item.count+' 段':'等待旅程展開'));b.appendChild(copy);b.appendChild(node('span',item.count?'›':'·','chapter-arrow'));if(item.count)b.style.setProperty('--chapter-image','url("'+chapterArtwork(memories.entries(item.number))+'")');}c.appendChild(grid);const footer=node('div',undefined,'chapter-gallery-footer');button(footer,review?'回到回看':active?'回到故事':'返回首頁',closeModal);if(review)button(footer,'返回旅程',()=>endReview(false),'primary');c.appendChild(footer);});}
function chapterViewControls(c){const tabs=node('div',undefined,'chapter-view-tabs');for(const [id,label]of [['cards','章節卡片'],['tree','章節樹']]){const b=button(tabs,label,()=>{chapterView=id;openChapters();});b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(chapterView===id));}c.appendChild(tabs);}
function openChapters(){return chapterView==='tree'?openChapterTree():openChapterCards();}
function openChapterTree(){if(!review){remember();importChapterMemories();}openModal('章節樹',c=>{$('modal').dataset.panel='chapter-tree';chapterViewControls(c);c.appendChild(node('p','只展開走過的路線。從任一片段開始，沿該路線回顧本章，不再出現選項。','route-intro'));const tree=node('div',undefined,'route-tree');for(const info of memories.list()){const section=node('section',undefined,'route-chapter'),head=node('h3',info.count?info.heading:'尚未抵達');section.dataset.chapter=info.number;section.appendChild(head);if(!info.count){section.classList.add('locked');tree.appendChild(section);continue;}const branch=memories.tree(info.number);if(branch.paths.length>1)section.appendChild(node('p','已走過 '+branch.paths.length+' 條回顧路線 · 共同開場 '+branch.common+' 段','route-summary'));for(const route of branch.paths){const path=node('div',undefined,'route-path');path.dataset.route=route.index;const header=node('div',undefined,'route-path-title');header.appendChild(node('span',branch.paths.length>1?'路線 '+(route.index+1):'已走過的路線'));button(header,'回顧整段',()=>beginReview(info.number,false,{index:route.index,from:0}));path.appendChild(header);for(const segment of route.segments){const b=button(path,'',()=>beginReview(info.number,false,{index:route.index,from:segment.at}),'route-node');b.appendChild(node('strong',segment.title));b.appendChild(node('small','已讀 '+segment.count+' 段 · 從此處回顧'));}section.appendChild(path);}tree.appendChild(section);}c.appendChild(tree);});}
function beginReview(number,previous=false,route=null){const entries=route?memories.routeEntries(number,route.index).slice(route.from||0):memories.entries(number,previous);if(!entries.length)return;const old=review;if(!old&&active&&JSON.stringify(readSlot('auto')?.snapshot)!==JSON.stringify(E.snapshot()))save('auto',true);const checkpoint=old?.checkpoint||{snapshot:E.state?E.snapshot():null,active,auto,skipping,readerPaused};voice.stop();stopTimers();auto=!!route;skipping=false;$('auto').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(auto));$('skip').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');readerPaused=false;lastEffectKey='';review={number,entries,at:0,checkpoint,route};if(!E.state)E.start();active=true;$('home').hidden=true;$('game').hidden=false;closeModal();lastScene=0;showReviewLine(0);}
function showReviewLine(at){if(!review)return;if(at>=review.entries.length){auto=false;$('auto').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');openModal('回憶抵達此處',c=>{c.appendChild(node('p','這些是你已經走過的片刻。','chapter-excerpt'));const g=node('div',undefined,'menu-grid');button(g,'重看本章',()=>{closeModal();showReviewLine(0);},'primary');button(g,'章節回憶',openChapters);button(g,review.checkpoint.active?'返回旅程':'返回首頁',()=>endReview(false));c.appendChild(g);});return;}review.at=Math.max(0,at);const line=review.entries[review.at];if(E.state.scene!==line.scene){E.state.scene=line.scene;E.sceneSerial++;}E.state.chapter=review.number;E.state.music=E.scene().music;E.state.portrait=line.portrait_mode===4?line.sprite_resource:null;E.waiting={...line};E.history=review.entries.slice(Math.max(0,review.at-100),review.at+1).map(x=>({kind:'dialogue',name:x.has_name?x.name:'',text:x.text,scene:x.scene,offset:x.offset}));render();}
function endReview(gallery=false){if(!review)return;const saved=review.checkpoint;voice.stop();stopTimers();review=null;if(saved.snapshot)E.restore(saved.snapshot);else{E.state=null;E.waiting=null;E.stack=[];E.history=[];E.seen=[];E.autoSeen=[];}active=saved.active;auto=saved.auto;skipping=saved.skipping;readerPaused=!!saved.readerPaused;$('auto').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(auto));$('skip').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(skipping));$('game').dataset.review='false';$('home').hidden=active;$('game').hidden=!active;closeModal();lastScene=0;if(active)render();else{music.set('',false);refreshContinue();reviewChrome();}if(gallery)openChapters();}
$('art-toggle').onclick=()=>changeArt(AzureRemake.mode==='hd'?'original':'hd');$('chapters-button').onclick=()=>review?endReview(false):openChapters();$('home-chapters').onclick=openChapters;syncArtControl();importChapterMemories();

function notify(msg){const t=$('toast');( $('modal').open?$('modal'):document.body).appendChild(t);t.textContent=msg;t.hidden=false;clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>t.hidden=true,3500);}
function img(path){if(!images.has(path))images.set(path,new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const x=new Image();x.onload=()=>resolve(x);x.onerror=()=>reject(Error('圖片載入失敗：'+path));x.src=D.assets?.[path]||path;}));return images.get(path);}
async function background(e){AzureRemake.background(e);const serial=++sceneRender,c=$('background'),ctx=c.getContext('2d');c.width=240;c.height=288;ctx.fillStyle='#09232e';ctx.fillRect(0,0,240,288);const valid=e.backgrounds.some(n=>D.images[n]);if(!valid){$('wallpaper').style.backgroundImage='none';return;}try{for(let l=0;l<3;l++){const name=e.backgrounds[l];if(!D.images[name])continue;const atlas=await img('assets/images/'+name);if(serial!==sceneRender)return;const cols=Math.floor(atlas.width/24),tiles=e.tiles[l];for(let i=0;i<tiles.length;i++){let tile=tiles[i];if(tile<0)tile=e.tileAnimations[l][-tile-1]?.[0]||0;if(tile<=0)continue;const sx=((tile-1)%cols)*24,sy=Math.floor((tile-1)/cols)*24;if(sy+24>atlas.height)continue;ctx.drawImage(atlas,sx,sy,24,24,(i%10)*24,Math.floor(i/10)*24,24,24);}}const wall='assets/images/'+e.backgrounds.find(n=>D.images[n]);$('wallpaper').style.backgroundImage='url("'+(D.assets?.[wall]||wall)+'")';}catch(error){notify(error.message);}}
async function portrait(){const scenePose=AzureRemake.scenePortrait(E.scene()),key=scenePose||E.state?.portrait;$('game').dataset.character=String(!!key);if(key&&AzureRemake.mode==='hd'&&AzureRemake.manifest.portraits[key]){frameKey='';await AzureRemake.drawPortrait(key,!!scenePose&&![71,104,121].includes(E.scene().id));return;}AzureRemake.clearPortrait();const legacyKey=E.state?.portrait,c=$('portrait'),s=D.sprites[legacyKey];if(!s){c.hidden=true;frameKey='';return;}c.hidden=false;if(frameKey!==key){frameKey=key;frameIndex=0;nextFrame=performance.now()+Math.max(50,s.frames[0].id||400);}const selected=s.frames[frameIndex%s.frames.length],seen=frameKey;try{const frame=await AzureOriginal.sprite(legacyKey,frameIndex);if(seen!==frameKey||AzureRemake.mode!=='original')return;c.width=frame.width;c.height=frame.height;c.getContext('2d').drawImage(frame,0,0);c.dataset.camera='original';c.dataset.sprite=legacyKey;originalCamera();}catch(error){notify(error.message);}}
function animatePortrait(now){AzureRemake.tick(now,active&&!document.hidden&&!$('modal').open);if(active&&frameKey&&!document.hidden){const s=D.sprites[frameKey];if(s&&s.frames.length>1&&now>=nextFrame){frameIndex=(frameIndex+1)%s.frames.length;const frame=s.frames[frameIndex];nextFrame=now+Math.max(50,frame.id||400);if(!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches)portrait();}}animate=requestAnimationFrame(animatePortrait);}requestAnimationFrame(animatePortrait);
function stopTimers(){clearInterval(textTimer);clearTimeout(autoTimer);typing=false;}
function completed(){clearInterval(textTimer);typing=false;$('line').textContent=full;refreshReadHint();E.markRead();remember();renderSegments();scheduleAuto();}
function refreshReadHint(){const l=$('line');if(E.waiting?.kind==='dialogue'&&l.scrollHeight-l.clientHeight-l.scrollTop>4){$('hint').textContent='向上滑動，或按繼續閱讀';$('next').textContent='繼續閱讀 ↓';}else{$('hint').textContent=matchMedia('(pointer:coarse)').matches?'輕觸繼續':'回車／空白鍵繼續';$('next').textContent='繼續 →';}}
function syncPlayback(){if(!active)return;const paused=readerPaused||voice.status==='paused'||voice.status==='blocked';$('playback-toggle').textContent=!auto?'自動':paused?'繼續':'暫停';$('playback-toggle').setAttribute('aria-label',!auto?'開始自動播放':paused?'繼續播放':'暫停播放');$('playback-toggle').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(auto&&!paused));$('auto').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(auto));const w=E.waiting,cinema=!!(auto&&prefs.subtitleStyle==='cinema'&&prefs.voiceMode==='recorded'&&voice.volume>0&&w?.kind==='dialogue'&&AzurePresentation.mode(w)!=='chapter'&&voice.progress.key===w.key&&['loading','playing','paused','ended'].includes(voice.status));document.body.dataset.cinema=String(cinema);}
function readingSize(){return Math.max(16,Math.min(60,(Math.floor((innerWidth*.92-40)/(Number(prefs.size)||19))*2)-2));}
function prepareReading(w,text){readingSession=new AzureReading.Session(w.key,text,prefs,readingSize());subtitleIndex=-1;renderSegments();}
function reflowReading(){if(readingSession&&readingSession.max!==readingSize()){readingSession.max=readingSize();readingSession.parts=AzureReading.segments(readingSession.text,readingSession.max);renderSegments();paintReading();}}
window.addEventListener('resize',reflowReading);
function renderSegments(){if(!readingSession||typing)return;subtitleIndex=-1;const l=$('line');l.replaceChildren();for(const part of readingSession.parts){const span=node('span',part.text,'reading-part');span.dataset.start=part.start;span.dataset.end=part.end;l.appendChild(span);}l.scrollTop=0;}
function paintReading(){if(!readingSession||E.waiting?.key!==readingSession.key)return;const index=readingSession.part,part=readingSession.parts[index];if(!part)return;$('cinema-speaker').textContent=E.waiting.has_name?E.waiting.name:'旁白';$('cinema-line').textContent=part.text.trim();$('cinema-counter').textContent=readingSession.parts.length>1?(index+1)+' / '+readingSession.parts.length:'';if(index!==subtitleIndex){subtitleIndex=index;const spans=$('line').querySelectorAll('.reading-part');for(const [i,s]of spans.entries())s.setAttribute('aria-current',String(i===index));const span=spans[index];if(auto&&span&&!typing){const l=$('line'),y=span.getBoundingClientRect().top-l.getBoundingClientRect().top+l.scrollTop-l.clientHeight*.25;l.scrollTop=Math.max(0,Math.min(l.scrollHeight-l.clientHeight,y));}}}
function scheduleAuto(){clearTimeout(autoTimer);if(active)syncPlayback();}
function nextAudioLine(){if(review)return review.entries[review.at+1];for(let f=E.stack.length-1;f>=0;f--){const frame=E.stack[f];for(let i=frame.at;i<frame.commands.length;i++){const c=frame.commands[i];if(c.kind==='dialogue')return{...c,scene:E.state.scene};if(c.kind==='choice'||c.kind==='conditional'||c.kind==='scene_jump'||[6,7,8,10,35,40].includes(c.opcode))return null;}}return null;}
function replayLine(){const w=E.waiting;if(w?.kind!=='dialogue'||AzurePresentation.mode(w)==='chapter')return Promise.resolve(false);const text=AzurePresentation.text(w);prepareReading(w,text);return voice.play(w,text);}
function togglePlayback(){if(!active)return;if(!auto){auto=true;readerPaused=false;skipping=false;if(typing)completed();if(voice.status==='paused')voice.resume();else if(voice.status==='blocked')voice.retry();else if(voice.status==='idle'&&prefs.voiceMode==='recorded')replayLine();}else if(readerPaused||voice.status==='paused'||voice.status==='blocked'){readerPaused=false;if(voice.status==='paused')voice.resume();else if(voice.status==='blocked')voice.retry();}else{readerPaused=true;voice.pause();}scheduleAuto();}
function applyProfile(id){const p=AzureReading.profiles[id];if(!p)return;const old=prefs.voiceMode;Object.assign(prefs,p,{profile:id});delete prefs.title;delete prefs.note;rememberArtSettings();voice.setRate(prefs.voiceRate);if(old!==prefs.voiceMode){voice.setMode(prefs.voiceMode);readingRestartVoice=prefs.voiceMode==='recorded';}if(readingSession)readingSession.prefs=prefs;try{localStorage.setItem(PREF,JSON.stringify(prefs))}catch{}syncPlayback();}
setInterval(()=>{const now=performance.now(),dt=Math.min(250,Math.max(0,now-readingTick));readingTick=now;if(!$('ending-screen').hidden||!active||!readingSession||E.waiting?.kind!=='dialogue'||readingSession.key!==E.waiting.key||$('modal').open||document.hidden||$('game').dataset.uiHidden==='true'||readerPaused||typing)return;if(skipping){readingSession.skipElapsed=(readingSession.skipElapsed||0)+dt;if(E.seen.includes(E.waiting.key)&&readingSession.skipElapsed>=90)advance(true);return;}if(voice.status==='blocked'){syncPlayback();return;}const finished=readingSession.tick(auto?dt:0,voice.progress);paintReading();syncPlayback();if(auto&&finished&&!readingSession.advanced){readingSession.advanced=true;advance(true);}},50);
function startTyping(text){stopTimers();full=text;chars=Array.from(text);cursor=0;$('line').textContent='';if(prefs.speed===0||skipping||auto){completed();return;}typing=true;textTimer=setInterval(()=>{cursor+=1;$('line').textContent=chars.slice(0,cursor).join('');if(cursor>=chars.length)completed();},Math.min(80,Math.max(8,prefs.speed)));}
function save(slot='auto',silent=false){if(review){if(!silent)notify('回看不會改變旅程進度。');return false;}try{const snapshot=E.snapshot();localStorage.setItem(SAVE+slot,JSON.stringify({savedAt:new Date().toISOString(),scene:E.scene().title,chapter:E.state.chapter,snapshot}));if(!silent)notify('回憶已保存到'+(slot==='auto'?'自動存檔':'存檔 '+slot));return true;}catch{if(!silent)notify('存檔失敗：瀏覽器儲存空間可能不可用，可改用匯出存檔。');return false;}}
function readSlot(slot){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(SAVE+slot)||'null')}catch{return null}}
function refreshContinue(){const valid=readSlot('auto');$('continue-game').disabled=!valid;}
function render(){if(!E.state)return;if(E.waiting?.kind!=='ending')hideFinale(false);setPictureView(false);voice.stop();let blank=0;const carried=[];while(AzurePresentation.isTransientBlank(E.waiting)&&blank++<50){carried.push(...(E.waiting.effects||[]));E.markRead();E.next();}if(carried.length)E.waiting.effects=[...carried,...(E.waiting.effects||[])];const w=E.waiting,e=E.scene();$('game').dataset.mode=AzurePresentation.mode(w);$('game').dataset.named=String(!!w.has_name);$('game').dataset.portrait=String(!!E.state.portrait);$('game').dataset.blank=String(e.backgrounds.every(n=>n==='map01000.png'));$('next').onclick=()=>advance();$('next').textContent='繼續 →';$('location').textContent=e.title;$('chapter-label').textContent=E.state.chapter?D.chapters[E.state.chapter-1].heading:'海風之前 · 序章';$('progress').textContent=E.state.chapter?'CHAPTER '+String(E.state.chapter).padStart(2,'0'):'PROLOGUE';if(lastScene!==E.sceneSerial){lastScene=E.sceneSerial;background(e);$('transition').classList.remove('active');void $('transition').offsetWidth;$('transition').classList.add('active');}portrait();AzureProps.render(w);$('stage').dataset.scene=String(e.id);const previousKey=review?(review.entries[review.at-1]?.key||(review.route?memories.routeEntries(review.number,review.route.index)[(review.route.from||0)-1]?.key:null)):null,fx=review?[...(sourceEffects.transitions.get(previousKey+'>'+w.key)||[]),...(sourceEffects.get(w.key)||[])]:w.effects,marker=E.sceneSerial+'|'+w.key+'|'+(review?.at??'live');if(lastEffectKey!==marker){lastEffectKey=marker;$('stage')._azureShake?.cancel();if(fx?.length)AzureCinematic.shake($('stage'),fx,prefs.effects!==false);}music.set(E.state.music,!!prefs.music).catch(()=>notify('音樂暫時無法播放，可在設定關閉後重試。'));$('choices').replaceChildren();$('choices').hidden=true;$('explore').hidden=true;$('next').hidden=false;$('speaker').textContent='';$('hint').textContent=window.matchMedia('(pointer:coarse)').matches?'輕觸繼續':'回車／空白鍵繼續';
if(w.kind==='dialogue'){$('speaker').textContent=w.has_name?w.name:'';const seen=E.seen.includes(w.key);if(skipping&&!seen){skipping=false;$('skip').setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');}const shown=AzurePresentation.text(w);prepareReading(w,shown);if(!skipping&&!$('modal').open&&AzurePresentation.mode(w)!=='chapter')voice.play(w,shown);if(readerPaused)voice.pause();startTyping(shown);const upcoming=nextAudioLine();if(upcoming)voice.preload(upcoming);paintReading();}
else{readingSession=null;syncPlayback();stopTimers();if(w.kind==='choice'){$('speaker').textContent='你的選擇';$('line').textContent='';$('line').style.minHeight='0';$('choices').hidden=false;$('next').hidden=true;w.options.forEach((o,i)=>{const b=node('button',o.text);b.onclick=()=>act(()=>E.choose(i));$('choices').appendChild(b);});$('hint').textContent='選擇之後，回憶將繼續。';}
else if(w.kind==='explore'){$('speaker').textContent='海風鎮';$('line').textContent='讓腳步慢一點，看看這座小鎮吧。';$('next').hidden=true;$('explore').hidden=false;$('interactions').replaceChildren();if(w.actions.length){for(const action of w.actions){const b=node('button',action.label);b.onclick=()=>act(()=>E.interact(action.actor));$('interactions').appendChild(b);}}else{$('interactions').appendChild(node('p','這裡暫時沒有可互動內容。可從選單讀取先前的存檔。'));}$('hint').textContent='點選場景中的互動按鈕。';}
else if(w.kind==='savepoint'){$('speaker').textContent='保存回憶';$('line').textContent='想把這一刻保存下來嗎？可按下方「存檔」，或繼續旅程。';}
else if(w.kind==='credits'){$('speaker').textContent='致謝';$('line').textContent='原作《戀愛物語：湛藍回憶》\n奧爾資訊多媒體 · Auer\n\n網頁介面與劇情呈現重製';}
else if(w.kind==='ending'){if(!review){endings.capture(E.snapshot());saveEndings();const id=endings.identify(E.snapshot());if(id){auto=false;syncPlayback();showFinale(id);}}$('speaker').textContent='回憶的盡頭';$('line').textContent='《ＴＨＥ　ＥＮＤ》';$('next').textContent='回到首頁 →';$('next').onclick=()=>home();}
else if(w.kind==='missing'){$('speaker').textContent='原始資料缺失';$('line').textContent='這段流程指向原始 JAR 中不存在的事件 '+w.target+'。已停止在這裡，沒有補寫劇情。你可以讀取先前存檔，或匯出進度保留。';$('next').hidden=true;}}
if(w.kind!=='choice')$('line').style.minHeight='';reviewChrome();save('auto',true);}
function act(fn){try{voice.stop();stopTimers();fn();render();}catch(e){stopTimers();openModal('流程暫停',c=>{c.appendChild(node('p',e.message));c.appendChild(node('p','進度保留，可匯出存檔供後續排查。'));button(c,'匯出存檔',exportSave);});}}
function advance(automatic=false){if($('modal').open||!active)return;if(typing){completed();return;}const l=$('line');if(!automatic&&E.waiting.kind==='dialogue'&&l.scrollHeight-l.clientHeight-l.scrollTop>4){l.scrollTop+=Math.max(40,l.clientHeight*.85);refreshReadHint();scheduleAuto();return;}if(E.waiting.kind==='ending'){home();return;}if(review){showReviewLine(review.at+1);return;}act(()=>E.next());}
function start(){lastEffectKey='';hideFinale(false);if(review)endReview(false);active=true;$('home').hidden=true;$('game').hidden=false;$('next').textContent='繼續 →';$('next').onclick=()=>advance();act(()=>E.start());}
function load(slot){if(review)endReview(false);const s=readSlot(slot);if(!s)return notify('這個位置還沒有存檔。');try{E.restore(s.snapshot);active=true;$('home').hidden=true;$('game').hidden=false;lastScene=0;$('next').onclick=()=>advance();closeModal();render();notify('已讀取回憶。');}catch(e){notify('無法讀取：'+e.message);}}
function home(){hideFinale(false);if(review)endReview(false);active=false;voice.stop();stopTimers();music.set('',false);$('home').hidden=false;$('game').hidden=true;closeModal();refreshContinue();}
